  "local_reply_contract": "31add535826a23417c95051ad1387b2ba698df48f872fd044a6450c15461a93d.json keeps the public PIK3CA indication page's native rows, trimmed to the retained fields. 77d11a643efe6e748f26a5a5779b6f22edc65a7afd4f8f7ce8b425648e4f6f6c.json is a synthetic control: one label named only in its indications section, and one whose product name appears in no other field. The Lithium bromatum (001cc8c5-3b3b-456f-8b62-46da8202ea49) and Kroger Baby Sunscreen (01a50047-0d07-41c5-b35b-129aab5b4afd) set_id replies keep the public bodies trimmed to the retained fields; their harmonized-set NOT_FOUND replies are as recorded. The Vicks VapoRub ADVANCED PLUS (0036d6fc-eed6-ee87-e063-6294a90a8022) set_id reply is kept the same way."
